  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country programme for inclusive and sustainable industrial development in Viet Nam (2025-2028)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The CP cycle will continue supporting ISID in the country in order to achieve its goals of becoming a high income with modern industry by 2045, targeting the intertwined challenges of enhancing local domestic industrial capability, enhancing the quantity and quality of export, and at the same time supporting the Government goals on green growth, net zero emission and other international commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
